ool call ID in the sentence.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested README change</summary>\n\n```diff\n-`failed` before any permission request as ungated-execution evidence and\n+`failed` before a permission request for the same `toolCallId` as ungated-execution evidence and\n```\n\n</details>","id":"86a22fe4d315e166093e4a278983828f2351b4f9055089ca8adb37d7cc0ef02f","intervals":[[589,589]],"path":"src/driver/README.md","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Scope the ungated-execution rule to the same tool call ID."}],"head":"4c80d0f3a6167db58c790886e7415b83069d51b8","head_tree":"d16e28012af19cbe4667ce22a44fed8d3e652014","input_scope":[{"blob":"29fe9ddfdee8b6c1107ccbacbe79018421fa1b86","intervals":[[4,11],[22,23],[32,32],[43,45],[56,85],[96,98],[114,115],[122,126],[152,177],[185,193],[199,201],[203,245],[258,259],[277,278],[290,290],[292,296],[298,298],[300,366],[368,387],[389,395],[397,401],[403,407],[411,413],[415,424],[426,447],[457,464],[466,482],[485,490],[492,493],[495,496],[498,506],[508,522],[524,530],[534,534],[588,590]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"}],"job_id":"23183c90c7662f391e6d031b6dbcefdc8ed749a87bca4301baf4ad87f7f7eb0d:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"entry":{"blob":"7adba676aa606b084fc7cf13676928e3ef94cbb3","kind":"blob","mode":"100644","path":"src/driver/README.md"},"merge":"6ad492e9bda60974cb02fdaa23834f11c050aa9c","method":"pre-merge","pre":"e9a3e15cca7355682f79a78311ff9158eaaf74fc","source_path":"src/driver/README.md"},"blob":"29fe9ddfdee8b6c1107ccbacbe79018421fa1b86","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/driver/README.md","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"29fe9ddfdee8b6c1107ccbacbe79018421fa1b86","intervals":[[175,176]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"29fe9ddfdee8b6c1107ccbacbe79018421fa1b86","intervals":[[175,176]],"path":